

Here’s how to maximize your chances of climbing the leaderboard:

✅ Connect everything early

Link your wallet and GitHub before December 8 so your full activity counts.

✅ Build simple but useful public projects

Tools, templates, small smart contracts, dashboards, or utilities often outperform complex, unfinished ideas.

✅ Keep your GitHub active and transparent

Frequent commits, clean documentation, and open repositories contribute both to scoring and professional reputation.

✅ Publish iteratively

Launch early, improve weekly. Consistency often scores higher than single bursts of activity.

✅ Focus on real value, not spam

Talent Protocol rewards genuine contributions — functional contracts, meaningful commits, good documentation, and real engagement.

✅ Make your Talent Protocol profile complete

A strong bio, verified identity, and well-defined projects improve credibility and visibility.
